### Create Course Record
POST http://localhost:8080/course/record/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "courseId": 1,
  "progress": 50
}

### Get Course Record by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/course/record/1

### Update Course Record
PUT http://localhost:8080/course/record/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "userId": 1,
  "courseId": 1,
  "progress": 75
}

### Delete Course Record
DELETE http://localhost:8080/course/record/1